}

DreamTabView:OnTabClosed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTabView.h#DreamTabView:OnTabClosed
    src   "A tab is closing. Fired BEFORE the page is destroyed and the caption dropped, so a consumer\nthat wants to keep the page can take it out of the switcher from here -- the same order\nUDreamDialog::Close broadcasts in, and for the same reason."
    text  "某个标签页即将关闭。此事件在页面被销毁、标题被丢弃之前触发，因此想要\n保留该页面的使用者可以在此把它从切换器中取出——与\nUDreamDialog::Close 广播的顺序相同，原因也相同。"
