    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTabView.h#DreamTabView:OnTabGenerated
    src   "One per tab, as the strip is built. The hook for a consumer whose tabs are richer than a word\nbut who would rather not author a whole class: everything under the tab is reachable from here\nby display name. The tab view's counterpart of the list's OnRowGenerated."
    text  "构建标签栏时，每个标签页触发一次。供标签页内容比一个词更丰富、\n却不愿编写整个类的使用者使用的钩子：标签页下的所有内容都可从此处\n按显示名称访问。相当于列表的 OnRowGenerated 在标签视图中的对应物。"
    state machine
}

