DreamTabView:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTabView.h#DreamTabView:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why\nit stays editable instead of being gated on the enum: the old edit condition greyed the\nexact values that were driving the control."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且确实存在样式表时，\n项目样式表优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这就是实际生效的外观——因此\n它保持可编辑，而不是由枚举控制：旧的编辑条件恰恰把\n正在驱动控件的那些值置灰了。"
    state machine
}

DreamTabView:TabEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTabView.h#DreamTabView:TabEnabled
    src   "Which tabs can be picked, index-matched to the strip -- the same parallel-array idiom TabLabels\nuses, and for the same reason: a struct per tab would make the common case (no opinion at all)\ncost an array literal the language cannot write.\n\nA missing entry means ENABLED, so a shorter list than the strip is an ordinary state and the\ndefault empty one disables nothing. A disabled tab is drawn in the style's TabDisabled colour\nand cannot be clicked; code may still open it through SetActiveTabIndex, which is the rule\neverywhere else in this library -- an interactable flag stops the PLAYER, not the program."
    text  "哪些选项卡可以被选中，按索引与选项卡条对应——与 TabLabels\n使用相同的平行数组惯用法，理由也相同：若为每个选项卡使用结构体，就会让最常见的情况（完全不表态）\n付出语言无法书写的数组字面量代价。\n\n缺少条目表示启用，因此列表比选项卡条短是普通状态，\n默认的空列表不会禁用任何选项卡。被禁用的选项卡以样式中的 TabDisabled 颜色\n绘制，且无法点击；代码仍可通过 SetActiveTabIndex 打开它，这也是本库其他地方的规则\n——可交互标志阻止的是玩家，而不是程序。"
    state machine
}

