DreamTabView:TabLabels {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamTabView.h#DreamTabView:TabLabels
    src   "The tab captions, index-matched to the pages. An entry names that tab; a missing or empty one\nleaves the tab wearing its page's node id (see the class comment). Longer than the page list\nis allowed and grows the strip -- a screen that authors its tabs before its pages should see\nthe strip it is building."
    text  "选项卡标题，按索引与页面匹配。条目为该选项卡命名；缺少或为空的条目\n会让选项卡沿用其页面的节点 ID（参见类注释）。允许比页面列表\n更长，并会扩展选项卡条——先编写选项卡再编写页面的界面应当能看到\n它正在构建的选项卡条。"
    state machine
}

